                            <p class="br-p">When you register through Say Affiliates and open an account with one of our partner brokers, a portion of the broker's spread or commission is returned to you as cashback — on every single lot you trade, regardless of whether the trade is profitable. The cashback is credited to your Say Affiliates wallet every week and can be withdrawn at any time.</p>
                        </div>

